{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"From recovery, replace osk.exe with cmd.exe so Win+U on the logon screen opens a prompt for net user admin *.","label":"Reset Password","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/remote_registry","label":"Remote Registry","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/remote_registry"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/robocopy","label":"Robocopy","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/robocopy"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tReset a local password from the recovery console by swapping the on-screen keyboard for <code class='inline'>cmd.exe<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: this replaces <code class='inline'>osk.exe<\/code> under <code class='inline'>c:\\Windows<\/code>. Revert after login.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Recovery console<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLog in to the recovery console:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>cd c:\\Windows\nmove osk.exe xosk.exe\ncp cmd.exe osk.exe<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tExit and restart.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Logon screen<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOn the password login screen, press Win+U and select Start On-Screen Keyboard. A command prompt should start instead of the on-screen keyboard.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>net user admin *<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEnter the new password. Login with this <code class='inline'>&lt;new-password&gt;<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Revert<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLog in to the recovery console again and restore <code class='inline'>osk.exe<\/code>:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>cd c:\\windows\nDel osk.exe\nmove xosk.exe osk.exe<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/reset_password\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/reset_password\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/remote_registry' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/remote_registry' data-title='Remote Registry' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Remote Registry<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/robocopy' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/robocopy' data-title='Robocopy' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Robocopy<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/windows.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Windows<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}